    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2619" root="بشق" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشِقَ</span></b> , aor.
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشَقَ</span></b> ; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشَقَ</span>, aor 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشِقَ</span></b> ; <i>He struck,
smote,</i> or <i>beat,</i> another with a staff or stick. (Nawádir el-Aaráb, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>He looked sharply, or
intently:</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, K:) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشْقٌ</span>. (JK.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also the former verb, <i>He hastened,</i> or <i>was
quick;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشَكَ</span>. (IDrd, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  And the
former, [but the aor. is not mentioned,] <i>He cut</i>
a garment, or piece of cloth, <i>in a light,</i> or <i>prompt,
manner;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشَكَ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A5-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشَقَ</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَشْقٌ</span>, <i>He took,</i> or <i>seized.</i> (Msb.)

